# 默认全部忽略，只放行配置文本（白名单）
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!.githooks/*
!profiles/*/cordis.yml
!profiles/*/cordis.patch.yml
!profiles/*/package.json
!profiles/*/pnpm-lock.yaml
!profiles/*/pnpm-workspace.yaml
# 插件策略：只放行 hand-written 规则，运行态与含凭据的配置仍被挡住
!dsh-plugins/dsh-guard/policy.json
!dsh-plugins/dsh-guard/policy.schema.json
dsh-plugins/*/audit.jsonl
dsh-plugins/*/status.json

# 显式再挡一层：任何位置都不进仓库
.credentials.yaml
*.env
*.env.*
**/settings.json
*.bak
backups/
sessions/
storages/
logs/
cache/
attachments/
node_modules/
